{"root":{"data":{"id":"dksq6kqvt8o0","created":1787122861741,"text":"学会提问"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksq6v1ia740","created":1787122884151,"text":"寻找论题","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksq9ftz3vk0","created":1787123086136,"text":"寻找论题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksqhu91jfs0","created":1787123744436,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dksq9lqtc2o0","created":1787123099006,"text":"寻找结论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksq9qkydb40","created":1787123109535,"text":"论题类型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksq9vt9br40","created":1787123120921,"text":"描述性论题","note":"描述是不是\n描述性论题是指关于各种对过去、现在或将来的\neg.音乐学习是不是有助于提高一个人的数学能力？"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqcvqevjc0","created":1787123355842,"text":"规定性论题","note":"规定性论题是指关于什么该做、什么不该做、什么是对、什么是错、什么是好、什么是坏的问题。\ne.g. 公立学校里应不应该教授智能设计？"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dksqi2o7j6g0","created":1787123762767,"text":"方法论"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dksqims62rk0","created":1787123806542,"text":"文章开头"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqis4703s0","created":1787123818153,"text":"寻找结论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dksqjfb8ieo0","created":1787123868645,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}